        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Elevating Nonprofits through Tin Cup</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47064.webp" alt="Elevating Nonprofits through Tin Cup" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>The Tin Cup Challenge is the Community Foundation of Teton Valley’s cornerstone program. Thanks to you and your participation, this unique fundraiser and event has grown year after year to become a mainstay of Teton Valley. Whether you engage as a donor, Challenger, board member, nonprofit staff, volunteer, competitor, or Fun Run entrant, your support unites the community. The Tin Cup Challenge illustrates how much we care for each other year-round in a thousand different ways.</p>

<p>Funds raised through the Tin Cup Challenge are reinvested directly into the community through nonprofit programs and services &#8211; providing meals, music, education, conservation, recreation, safety, connection, and resources. These funds help organizations cover critical costs, including salaries, rent, and program expenses.</p>

<p><strong>16th Annual</strong> <strong>Tin Cup Challenge</strong><br><strong>Total Funds Raised: $2,826,791</strong><br><br><strong>1,412</strong> Donors <br><strong>279</strong> Business &amp; Community Challengers<br><strong>60</strong> Nonprofits<br><strong>55%</strong> Match Grant<br><br><strong>Cumulative Total:</strong><br><strong>$23.6 </strong>million</p>

<p>In addition to a Matching Grant for participating nonprofits, the Foundation’s Challenger Fund is further distributed through Youth Philanthropy and Competitive Grant awards to impact needs across Teton Valley strategically.</p>

<p>This annual collaborative appeal brings the community together to raise funds and awareness for our active and invested nonprofit community. Tin Cup Event Day marks the culmination of fundraising efforts and allows the community to gather to celebrate collective impact and the difference each of you makes in elevating lives through your supportive actions and engagement.</p>

<p>We are proud to be part of a community that values collaboration, generosity, and positive impact. Thank you to all who have supported our efforts and helped make these resources and more possible.</p>
        </div>

